{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12420","headline":"送严维尉河南 · 钱起","name":"送严维尉河南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蕙叶青青花乱开，少年趋府下蓬莱。\n甘泉未献扬雄赋，吏道何劳贾谊才。\n征陌独愁飞盖远，离筵只惜暝钟催。\n欲知别後相思处，愿植琼枝向柏台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}